For all designs I ask you to make, have them be beautiful, not cookie cutter. Make webpages that are fully featured and worthy for production.

By default, this template supports JSX syntax with Tailwind CSS classes, React hooks, and Lucide React for icons. Do not install other packages for UI themes, icons, etc unless absolutely necessary or I request them.

Use icons from lucide-react for logos.

Import project modules with the `@/` path alias, which maps to `src/` (e.g. `@/components/Foo` == `src/components/Foo`), instead of deep relative paths like `../../components/Foo`.
## Test safety (standing rule)
- Tests never modify real data, roles, triggers or users. No DISABLE TRIGGER, no non-TEMP backup tables, no creating/deleting users.
- Use a single BEGIN ... ROLLBACK under simulated sessions (SET LOCAL ROLE + JWT claims), or stop and ask.
- Report SQLSTATE and message for every expected failure; "0 rows" alone is not evidence.
- Functions used by RLS policies (is_writer, is_owner) stay executable by authenticated; never revoke grants without a viewer SELECT test afterwards.
- Trigger functions: revoke EXECUTE from PUBLIC, anon, authenticated.
- Never create, edit or delete users, passwords or invitations unless the task says so. No destructive SQL (DROP, TRUNCATE, DELETE without WHERE) without approval.
- Service worker caches only the static shell, never API/auth responses.